      "type": "text",
      "value": "A hydro-electric power plant as shown in the figure Q.7c takes in 30m³/s of water through (13) its turbine and discharges it to the atmosphere at 2m/s velocity. The head loss in the turbine and penstock system is 20 m. Assuming turbulent flow, α= 1.06, estimate power extracted by the turbine. If the generator in the plant has loss of about 15%, how much power is generated from the plant?"
